  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"17\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/tips_logo.gif\" width=\"200\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/alpha_background.gif\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"30\" width=\"594\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;<b><img align=\"absbottom\" border=\"0\" height=\"30\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/i.gif\" width=\"30\">CE \n                            DUNGEON(아이스던전)</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"290\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"280\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/dungeon/icedungeon_map.gif\" width=\"320\"></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"300\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>던전설명 \n                                        :</b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">미녹에서 \n                            북서쪽으로 가시면 아이스던전까지</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">가실 \n                            수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물론 \n                            상당히 먼거리에 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">롱던전 \n                            바로 위에 위치에 있으므로 롱던전에서</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">올라가셔도 \n                            됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">유[Yew]마을에서는 \n                            동쪽으로 가시면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">-----------------------------------------------</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_1.gif\" width=\"11\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_2.gif\" width=\"11\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_3.gif\" width=\"11\"> \n                                        : 던전이동지역</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(같은 모양의 아이콘끼리 \n                                        이동됩니다)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"9\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_4.gif\" width=\"13\"> \n                                        : 비밀문이나 잠김문</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_5.gif\" width=\"11\"> \n                                        : 던전내 중요 지점</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(클릭 하시면 상세정보를 \n                                        보실 수 있습니다)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">----------------------------------------------</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" height=\"976\" width=\"594\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"499\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"288\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"300\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/dungeon/icedungeon_1.gif\" usemap=\"#ImageMap2\" width=\"300\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"211\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>던전입구</b></span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>주요 \n                                        몬스터 :</b></font></span><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Lizard_man/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>\n</b></font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/RatMan/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">RatMan(랫맨-쥐돌이)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902131632/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/RatMan%20Archer.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">RatMan \n                                        Archer(랫맨아쳐)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902131632/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/RatMan%20Mage.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">RatMan \n                                        Mage(랫맨메이지)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902131632/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/Frost%20Ooze.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Frost \n                                        Ooze(슬라임)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902131632/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/Frost%20Troll.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Frost \n                                        Troll(프로스트 트롤)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Frost_Spider/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Frost \n                                        Spider(프로스트 스파이더)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/GiantIceSerpent/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Giant \n                                        Ice \n                                        Serpent(아이스 큰뱀)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902131632/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/Ice%20Snake.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Ice \n                                        Snake(아이스 스네이크)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902131632/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/Arctic%20Ogre%20Lord.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Arctic \n                                        Ogre Lord(아틱 오거 로드)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902131632/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/Ice%20Elemetal.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Ice \n                                        Elemental(아이스엘리)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20030902131632/http://forg.co.kr:80/dungeon/Snow%20Elemental.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Snow \n                                        Elemental(스노우 엘리)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Whte_Wyrm/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">White \n                                        Wyrm(화이트웜)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">※ \n                                        몬스터의 구성중에 특히 중요한</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">것은 \n                                        아이스던전에 있는 몬스터중에</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">근처에만 \n                                        있어도 냉기의 피해를 주는 것도 있습니다..</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/l_line.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><